    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War is almost over, take control of tank KV2 in this top down extraction shooter and embark on a mission to raid\u00a0 a military outpost filled with landmines which has been abandoned\u00a0by enemy forces.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Loot at least <strong>250</strong> Nuclear Nukes and deliver it at the extraction point.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468790/extras/2c8902f7b5ccfa10cf349bb50a77c794.poster.avif?t=1752157376\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468790/extras/2c8902f7b5ccfa10cf349bb50a77c794.webm?t=1752157376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468790/extras/2c8902f7b5ccfa10cf349bb50a77c794.mp4?t=1752157376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Health and Ammo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Search the outpost to replenish your health and ammo by collecting health and ammo boxes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468790/extras/f7bea3a312cf38a319d35f6452529f0e.poster.avif?t=1752157376\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468790/extras/f7bea3a312cf38a319d35f6452529f0e.webm?t=1752157376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468790/extras/f7bea3a312cf38a319d35f6452529f0e.mp4?t=1752157376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Leveling up gives you more health and ammo storing Capacities. Destroying\u00a0 turrets,\u00a0 \u00a0bunkers and tanks is the only way to level up.</p>",
